Track 2: The Griot's Ledger

- Story & Context: Old Man Dragan, a former railway signalman, kept a tattered ledger of all the messages he'd intercepted on the city's defunct communication lines, his stories of missed connections and coded warnings becoming the inspiration for Zara’s most profound verses. His fingers, gnarled from years of pulling levers, traced lines of sorrow across the worn pages, revealing the true cost of silence. "Every missed signal, every whispered word, etched in this ledger, unheard."
